| Flat: every clip as Test does, but where a clip has no scaling lists
| hevcdec is given flat ones (-s: all 16, which is what "no scaling
| lists" means), so the block's scaling factors are loaded. Reports to
| ResultS.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 32768K -max 32768K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultS
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -s -n -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultS <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -s -n -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultS <Obey$Dir>.clips.slices.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -s -n -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultS <Obey$Dir>.clips.nowpp.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -s -n -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultS <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.trace
Run <Obey$Dir>.hevctest -s -n -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultS <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.trace
